:false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120009","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120009.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120009.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-26T19:39:27Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nChanges the layered texture importer behavior to not force resize VRAM-compressed images to the next power of 2.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis was seemingly the behavior prior to #72031, where BPTC and S3TC textures would not require resizing, but ETC and ETC2 ones always did (even for regular 2D textures). \r\nSaid PR modified the 2D texture import process to never require the resizing, but on the other hand enforced it for layered textures of all types.\r\nI was unable to find a reason why this might be necessary, so I'm assuming it was a mistake made while copying code.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120009/reacti